# Directories
.claude
# src/bin/* (not "src/bin") so the font-asset exceptions below actually
# take effect -- git never descends into a directory that's ignored as a
# whole, so a bare "src/bin" would silently defeat any "!src/bin/..."
# negation, which is exactly what happened here the first time.
src/bin/*
# ...except the font asset, which src/src/kernel/mods/core/fontman/font_data.asm
# embeds directly into the kernel via incbin -- unlike everything else in
# src/bin (optional test/demo fixtures the build doesn't need to succeed),
# this one's a real build dependency: without it, nasm fails to assemble
# font_data.asm and the kernel build breaks entirely. See docs/DOCS.md
# ("Font Rendering System") for the full story.
!src/bin/fonts

# Binary Files
*.dat
*.obj
*.bin
*.img
*.iso
*.o

# Other
*.DS_Store 
.vscode
*.yml
experemental
docker

# Files to ignore
main.asm
main.lua